{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785927372750", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "chatcmpl-tool-be1db7b07fc8e339", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "curl -sL \"https://edsi.umd.edu/projects/benchmark-data-collection\" -o /tmp/edsi.html 2>&1; python3 -c \"\nimport re\nwith open('/tmp/edsi.html') as f:\n    h = f.read()\n# strip tags\ntext = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', h)\ntext = re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', text)\nprint(text[:3000])\n\" 2>&1", "description": "Check EDSI dataset page"}}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "e7360ec5-26e0-49a2-a036-6bd81ee197b7", "uuid": "d847b332-1e56-48df-94ce-55c735ac396c"}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-83f2e1db9084aeb1", "type": "tool_result", "content": "=== arxiv (5 results) ===\n  1. The RSNA Abdominal Traumatic Injury CT (RATIC) Dataset\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19595\n     [authors=Jeffrey D. Rudie, Hui-Ming Lin, Robyn L. Ball, Sabeena Jalal, Luciano M. Prevedello, Savvas Nicolaou, Brett S. Marinelli, Adam E. Flanders, Kirti Magudia, George Shih, Melissa A. Davis, John Mongan, Peter D. Chang, Ferco H. Berger, Sebastiaan Hermans, Meng Law, Tyler Richards, Jan-Peter Grunz, Andreas Steven Kunz, Shobhit Mathur, Sandro Galea-Soler, Andrew D. Chung, Saif Afat, Chin-Chi Kuo, Layal Aweidah, Ana Villanueva Campos, Arjuna Somasundaram, Felipe Antonio Sanchez Tijmes, Attaporn Jantarangkoon, Leonardo Kayat Bittencourt, Michael Brassil, Ayoub El Hajjami, Hakan Dogan, Muris Becircic, Agrahara G. Bharatkumar, Eduardo Moreno Júdice de Mattos Farina, Dataset Curator Group, Dataset Contributor Group, Dataset Annotator Group, Errol Colak | published=2024-05-30 | primary_category=cs.CV | id=2405.19595]\n  2. The RSNA Lumbar Degenerative Imaging Spine Classification (LumbarDISC) Dataset\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.09162\n     [authors=Tyler J. Richards, Adam E. Flanders, Errol Colak, Luciano M. Prevedello, Robyn L. Ball, Felipe Kitamura, John Mongan, Maryam Vazirabad, Hui-Ming Lin, Anne Kendell, Thanat Kanthawang, Salita Angkurawaranon, Emre Altinmakas, Hakan Dogan, Paulo Eduardo de Aguiar Kuriki, Arjuna Somasundaram, Christopher Ruston, Deniz Bulja, Naida Spahovic, Jennifer Sommer, Sirui Jiang, Eduardo Moreno Judice de Mattos Farina, Eduardo Caminha Nunes, Michael Brassil, Megan McNamara, Johanna Ortiz, Jacob Peoples, Vinson L. Uytana, Anthony Kam, Venkata N. S. Dola, Daniel Murphy, David Vu, Dataset Contributor Group, Dataset Annotator Group, Competition Data Notebook Group, Jason F. Talbott | published=2025-06-10 | primary_category=eess.IV | id=2506.09162]\n  3. MLCPD: A Unified